WEBVTT

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:05.037 line:92% size:92%
Our mission: to reduce the use of agrochemicals in agriculture.

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:10.108 line:92% size:92%
We have spent more than ten years researching formulations and nanotechnology.

00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:19.514 line:92% size:92%
That is why our 10GW formula does not clog nozzles like other biologicals, needs no refrigeration and is easy to use.

00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:27.423 line:92% size:92%
In our state-of-the-art laboratory, a trained team looks after every batch with strict quality control.

00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:34.400 line:92% size:92%
We research formulas with more active ingredient, to lower the dose, whether preventive or curative.

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:41.298 line:92% size:92%
We look for new microorganisms for new blends and pest control, and new gels to control bacteria.

00:00:41.600 --> 00:00:46.280 line:92% size:92%
We even study microorganisms that help break down chemical products.

00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:53.225 line:92% size:92%
Demeter: science for agriculture with fewer chemicals.
